{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/54d7274a5290143a3bb37fcbdef5669c.poster.avif?t=1766032537\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/54d7274a5290143a3bb37fcbdef5669c.webm?t=1766032537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/54d7274a5290143a3bb37fcbdef5669c.mp4?t=1766032537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the wonderful world with baby Ogu!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Ogu and the Secret Forest' is a 2D adventure game with hand-drawn characters and various types of puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend bouncy characters and defeat strange creatures to unravel the mystery of the charming world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/bb0d31dc89f580dcd58ea600075d0165.avif?t=1766032537\" width=616 height=130 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/39bbabd0334f766d099a2f14e5c81dc5.poster.avif?t=1766032537\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/39bbabd0334f766d099a2f14e5c81dc5.webm?t=1766032537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/39bbabd0334f766d099a2f14e5c81dc5.mp4?t=1766032537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various types of areas. Each area has a unique atmosphere and story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and find hints to reveal secrets and mysteries that are undisclosed for a long time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/45191b44e169263c00ba866c1d109196.avif?t=1766032537\" width=616 height=130 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/aeeff0e76ece41ee6bbda0e0fc1b13d9.poster.avif?t=1766032537\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/aeeff0e76ece41ee6bbda0e0fc1b13d9.webm?t=1766032537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/aeeff0e76ece41ee6bbda0e0fc1b13d9.mp4?t=1766032537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From recognizable classic puzzles to unique ones, various types of puzzles are waiting for you to visit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/ff0149d5837baa0c5e78753b22db1622.avif?t=1766032537\" width=616 height=130 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/e0e8799777f68684da200b238dacbe98.poster.avif?t=1766032537\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/e0e8799777f68684da200b238dacbe98.webm?t=1766032537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/e0e8799777f68684da200b238dacbe98.mp4?t=1766032537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The power of the Great One has been shattered and lots of vicious adversaries are keen on gathering the scattered pieces of the Great One\u2019s power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome these fearsome enemies to save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/18df9ad2df69066e9bd5b7ab0cd9c7e2.avif?t=1766032537\" width=616 height=130 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/0a8bd4094eff011b1bbe2bb5f94537ea.poster.avif?t=1766032537\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/0a8bd4094eff011b1bbe2bb5f94537ea.webm?t=1766032537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/0a8bd4094eff011b1bbe2bb5f94537ea.mp4?t=1766032537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hats and Masks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your explorer\u2019s hat and go find various awesome hats and masks! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress Baby Ogu with these items and some of them might have some special skills attached. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drawings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many landmarks out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw fancy objects and landscapes to discover new lands and you might also find hints in them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet friends on your journey and help those in need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They might help you with their unique skills or gifts. You\u2019re not alone in this world!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Whole New World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1985960/3b494e4045ecedad1d6b2bbdf41f3c0b4af8386d.jpg"},{"name":"Adventure Begins!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1985960/5c7bcfb43523dea4d8eb01a18aebaf0493de70b3.jpg"},{"name":"Darkness Be Gone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1985960/f0726f78582c30e8b9b8c539b601a03de2be2634.jpg"},{"name":"Cheers!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1985960/a1dce69c215c51185b74f9c173b9d4616689773e.jpg"},{"name":"Foil the scheme","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1985960/f330ca951aae0712992404eac9a507ba8b7ba72e.jpg"},{"name":"Peaceful Ocean","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1985960/518279474998e371090a001d41d00178d03e606d.jpg"},{"name":"Achieve harmony","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1985960/f92472d56c373976fc58e1af2713333907d135d1.jpg"},{"name":"The Divine Beast of the Earth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1985960/9ec20d52cbbf38a913f7afd2735ae1cfc5fadf3b.jpg"},{"name":"The Divine Beast of the Sky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1985960/3852d9543485cad2179ed9cac47caee3e6d83401.jpg"},{"name":"The Divine Beast of the Ocean","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1985960/e9f11695a16dc8b6281426efde