 various types of puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend bouncy characters and defeat strange creatures to unravel the mystery of the charming world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/bb0d31dc89f580dcd58ea600075d0165.avif?t=1766032537\" width=616 height=130 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/39bbabd0334f766d099a2f14e5c81dc5.poster.avif?t=1766032537\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/39bbabd0334f766d099a2f14e5c81dc5.webm?t=1766032537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/39bbabd0334f766d099a2f14e5c81dc5.mp4?t=1766032537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various types of areas. Each area has a unique atmosphere and story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and find hints to reveal secrets and mysteries that are undisclosed for a long time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/45191b44e169263c00ba866c1d109196.avif?t=1766032537\" width=616 height=130 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985960/extras/aeeff0e76ece41ee6bbda0e0fc1b13d9.poster.avif?t=1766032537\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co